\item[S2] Boris Shapiro, Problems Around Polynomials -- The Good, The Bad and The Ugly, Arnold Mathematical Journal 1 (2015), pp.91--104, Conjecture 9 and its complete preceding definitions. Original question and full discussion. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/1503.05295}.

